@segment 22-24 Wetlands I
@start-level 22
# Skyborne Druid. Same quests, order, hearth binds and flight paths as the Dwarf original (Dwarf segment 07).
# Carry-in: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (Duskwood and Westfall, segment 11), 455 (Algaz Gauntlet, handed in here).
# Carry-out: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (segment 11), 275, 295, 471 (Wetlands, level 26-27, segment 10).
# Hearth: Thelsamar at the start, Menethil Harbor from the harbor on.
# Changes from the Dwarf original:
# - The Dwarf's class quests removed (hand-in 94499 and pick-up 94500 at Hervdana Saegrund). The side trip that disappeared: from
#   the Wetlands end of the Dun Algaz road east along the southern cliffs to her cave under the waterfalls (65.7, 76.4)
#   and back to the road. The Dun Algaz road itself stays (455), and so does the south-east marsh (276 gnolls).
# - Training: the optional gryphon round trip Menethil -> Ironforge -> Menethil is gone (no druid trainer in
#   Ironforge) and nothing replaces it here: segment 9 goes to the druid trainer in Darnassus right after the boat
#   (Cat Form chain), so level 24 is trained there. No Teleport: Moonglade trip here either: the Hearthstone must be
#   ready as the fallback of that chain.
# - No travel form below level 30: the long road stretches are walked. No Cat Form yet in this segment.
# Left out on purpose: 98459 A Lack of Virtue (ForeverChanges puts its giver, Tom "Half-fish" Wilson, in the
# Hillsbrad Foothills at 51.2, 66.5, not in the Wetlands), 463 The Greenwarden (you meet Rethiel before its giver),
# 1132 Fiora Longears (Theramore), 98190 A Friend of the Family (taken in segment 10), 161/274 (Dun Modr).
@carry 57,67,157,161,181,240,453,455,93963,97894
